[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11643.349, "timestamp": "03:14:03", "text": "不，按钮的每个值都对应一个按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11645.269, "timestamp": "03:14:05", "text": "最大值，最小值。每个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11648.71, "timestamp": "03:14:08", "text": "它们都会有一个按钮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11651.03, "timestamp": "03:14:11", "text": "另外，总的来说，我会建议"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11652.87, "timestamp": "03:14:12", "text": "反对，因为游戏会自动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11655.349, "timestamp": "03:14:15", "text": "反正它也会为你这么做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11660.309, "timestamp": "03:14:20", "text": "哦，对了，在《战争雷霆》中，按键绑定是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11663.19, "timestamp": "03:14:23", "text": "它本身就是一个小游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11667.59, "timestamp": "03:14:27", "text": "哦，所以要把所有这些钥匙都这样放好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11669.15, "timestamp": "03:14:29", "text": "你想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11671.349, "timestamp": "03:14:31", "text": "这大概需要半小时左右。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11674.71, "timestamp": "03:14:34", "text": "还有一个小时。什么？如何做中间部分"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11676.309, "timestamp": "03:14:36", "text": "那玩意儿？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11679.03, "timestamp": "03:14:39", "text": "中间那个东西？你说我，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11681.91, "timestamp": "03:14:41", "text": "不要把它当作钥匙夹。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11685.91, "timestamp": "03:14:45", "text": "好的。是的。我刚查了一下。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11688.99, "timestamp": "03:14:48", "text": "在对照组中。前往"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11691.469, "timestamp": "03:14:51", "text": "控制。控制"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11694.79, "timestamp": "03:14:54", "text": "模式和切换控制模式。给它一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11696.389, "timestamp": "03:14:56", "text": "按键绑定。就在那里。没错"}]